Ace3
The Pagle addon's libs folder (Pagle/libs in the release, addons/Pagle/libs
in the source) holds LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0, AceAddon-3.0, AceEvent-3.0
and AceDB-3.0 from Ace3, https://github.com/WoWUIDev/Ace3, under their own
licence in LICENSE.txt in that libs folder.

Fonts
The announcement frames are set in fonts bundled in Pagle/media/fonts, each
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 in the OFL-*.txt file beside it: IM Fell
English (Igino Marini), Caveat (The Caveat Project Authors; the Medium,
SemiBold and Bold files are static cuts of its variable font) and Marcellus
(Astigmatic).
The Curio Shop is set in the same fonts, with IM Fell English's italic
(IMFeENit28P.ttf) as well, under the same licence.
The Field report and QoL's frames use them too, with Cutive Mono (The Cutive
Project Authors), which types the Field report.
